---

### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# === Core OS / System Files ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# === Local Configurations & Secrets ===
.env
.env.local
.env.production
*.pem
*.key
*.secret

# === Python / Backend Dependencies ===
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# === Container / Runtime Cache ===
.docker/
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# === Infrastructure-as-Code (Terraform) ===
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log

# === Testing & Quality Reports ===
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
coverage.xml
*.cover
tfsec-report.json
checkov-report.json
```</EOF>
